s001_hints_from_other_languages.pseudo:3:1: Syntax error S001: A FOR loop ends with NEXT, as in NEXT Index
   ENDFOR
   ^
s001_hints_from_other_languages.pseudo:4:1: Syntax error S001: There is no ELSEIF. Write ELSE, then the IF on the next line with its own ENDIF
   ELSEIF
   ^
